1
00:00:01,730 --> 00:00:06,190
Listen, sir, for the last time, I don't care what the computer says.
聽著，先生，我最後一次告訴你 我不在乎電腦上登記了什麼

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,630
We did not take a bag of Mashuga Nuts from the minibar.
我們沒有從房間冰箱 拿走一包糖果

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,570
And we did not watch Dr. Do-Me-A-Little.
我們沒有看《熱心助人的醫生》

4
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:20,170
-Joey, were you in our room last night? -No.
-喬伊，昨晚你到過我們房間？ -沒有

5
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:31,820
I was told the name of the movie would not appear on the bill.
他們說電影片名 不會出現在帳單上

6
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:37,860
-We're checking out of the bridal suite. -That's right, I'm no longer a bride.
-我們要退掉新房了 -沒錯，我不再是新娘

7
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:42,270
I'll never be a bride again. Now I'm just someone's wife.
我永遠都當不了新娘 現在我是某人的太太

8
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:46,570
And I'm the happiest guy in the world.
現在我是全世界最快樂的男人

9
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:51,080
Honey, don't be upset. We still have so much to look forward to.
甜心，別難過 我們還是有很光明的未來

10
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:52,650
Yeah, right.
對

11
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:55,840
-We got the honeymoon. -That's not till Thursday.
-我們還要去度蜜月 -那是星期四的事

12
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:58,510
-The wedding pictures. -It won't be ready for weeks.
-還有婚紗照 -那得等上好幾個星期

13
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:01,250
Not the disposable cameras from the tables.
但婚宴上用即可拍 拍的照片馬上可以洗好

14
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:04,520
That's true. I knew I married you for a reason!
沒錯 我就知道我嫁給你是有原因的

15
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:08,760
Tell you what, I will go get them developed, and you can go home.
聽著，我拿照片去洗 你先回家吧

16
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:15,500
-What? What did you take a picture of? -Nothing.
-什麼？你拍了什麼？ -沒什麼

17
00:01:15,670 --> 00:01:17,330
It was something.
一定很精彩

18
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:21,100
Ross has the cameras. Has he checked out yet?
即可拍在羅斯那裡 他還沒有退房嗎？

19
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:24,510
Are you joking? Checkout is not till noon.
你在開玩笑嗎？ 退房時間是中午

20
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:28,950
-And he has a good 11 minutes left. -So?
-他還有11分鐘 -所以呢？

21
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:32,420
So Ross had never checked out of a room a minute before he had to.
羅斯從來不會 提早退房

22
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:35,420
One time, when we were dating, we got a late checkout.
我們在交往的時候 有一次延後退房

23
00:01:35,590 --> 00:01:39,030
He got so excited, it was the best sex we ever had.
他非常興奮 那是我們最棒的性經驗

24
00:01:39,330 --> 00:01:42,920
Until he screamed out "Radisson" at the end.
直到他最後 大叫著「拉迪森」

25
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:48,500
Okay, well, I'm gonna get Ross, get the cameras and get them developed.
好吧，我去找羅斯拿照相機 然後把底片拿去洗

26
00:01:50,410 --> 00:01:53,240
32, Joe. You're 32!
喬伊，你32歲了

27
00:01:55,610 --> 00:01:58,040
-Here's a copy of your bill. -Thanks.
-這是你的帳單 -謝謝

28
00:01:58,450 --> 00:02:01,610
Champagne, strawberries..
香檳，草莓…

29
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:07,350
Oh, my God! I can't believe Chandler ordered porn on our wedding night.
天啊，我不敢相信 錢德在我們的新婚之夜看黃色電影

30
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:13,030
Yeah, that's sad. Mashuga Nut?
對，那真的很慘 糖果？

31
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,595
The One With The Red Sweater
本集播出：紅色毛衣

00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,595
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

32
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:56,200
I have six minutes left!
我還有六分鐘

33
00:02:56,370 --> 00:02:57,630
It's me.
是我

34
00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:06,110
Soaps, shampoos. Are you really taking all this stuff?
肥皂，洗髮精 你真的要把這些東西帶走？

35
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:09,310
Why not? It's built into the price of the room.
為什麼不行？ 這全包含在房費裡

36
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:13,210
Yeah, but you don't need.. What is this?
對，但你不需要… 這是什麼？

37
00:03:13,390 --> 00:03:15,120
Thread.
針線包

38
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,950
Score!
答對了

39
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:22,360
-Where are the disposable cameras? -What cameras?
-即可拍在哪裡？ -什麼即可拍？

40
00:03:22,530 --> 00:03:25,520
-Last night I asked you to take them. -No, you didn't.
-昨晚我把它們交給你 -才沒有

41
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:29,000
Yes, remember? Right before we cut the cake, I said..
就是有，記得嗎？ 在切蛋糕前我說…

42
00:03:29,170 --> 00:03:31,660
Yeah, you asked me if I could do you a favor.
對，你問我 能不能幫你一個忙

43
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:34,930
Then my Uncle Murray came up to you and handed you a check.
這時墨瑞叔叔走過來 交給你一張支票

44
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:39,370
Then you said, "Why is it called a check? Why not a Yugoslavian?"
然後你說「它為什麼叫做支票？ 為什麼不叫南斯拉夫人？」

45
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:46,510
Then you did that, and my Uncle Murray looked at me like:
然後你那麼做 墨瑞叔叔這樣看著我

46
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:50,550
-So you don't have the cameras? -No, sorry.
-即可拍不在你手上？ -沒錯，抱歉

47
00:03:50,730 --> 00:03:53,420
So, what? They're gone? Monica's gonna freak!
什麼？相機不見了？ 摩妮卡會氣瘋的

48
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:56,500
I'm sure they're here somewhere. I'll help you look.
我相信它們應該就在某個地方 我幫你找

49
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:58,890
-Great. -In three minutes.
-太棒了 -再等三分鐘

50
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:19,950
Are you gonna open the presents without Chandler?
你要丟下錢德 自己拆禮物？

51
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:23,150
No! I'm just..
不，我只是…

52
00:04:24,390 --> 00:04:29,390
They're calling out to me. This little guy even crawled up in my lap.
它們在呼換我 這個小傢伙甚至爬到我的膝蓋上

53
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:34,560
Chandler wouldn't mind if I opened just one present. What do you think it is?
錢德不會介意我拆開一樣禮物 你覺得它是什麼？

54
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:37,930
A little mirror that, when you look into it..
是一面小鏡子 只要你一照它…

55
00:04:38,110 --> 00:04:40,900
you see yourself as an old woman.
你會發現自己變成了老太婆

56
00:04:43,110 --> 00:04:45,340
A tiny salt shaker!
是一個迷你鹽罐

57
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:49,420
Oh, my God, for tiny salt!
天啊，是用來裝迷你鹽的

58
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:53,750
Oh, wow! Okay. Well, that was fun. That was fun.
好吧，那真的很好玩 很好玩

59
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:57,250
Okay, I'll just wait for Chandler to open up the rest of them.
我會等錢德 一起拆開其他禮物

60
00:04:58,890 --> 00:05:04,350
Although, you know, this is part of a salt-and-pepper set.
但這只是調味瓶組的 一部份

61
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:08,070
It may just count as only half a present. What do you think?
或許它只算半項禮物 你覺得呢？

62
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:12,610
I guess it's okay to open one more if it's part of a set. It's probably this one.
我猜如果它是一套的，再拆開一樣 應該沒關係，或許是這個

63
00:05:12,770 --> 00:05:14,540
Or this one!
或是這個

64
00:05:18,150 --> 00:05:22,340
-How are you? Got any morning sickness? -The guys don't know yet, do they?
-你好嗎？會害喜嗎？ -男生們還不知道吧？

65
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:26,010
Joey and Ross don't know anything. Chandler thinks Phoebe's pregnant.
喬伊跟羅斯什麼都不知道 錢德認為是菲比懷孕了

66
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:29,350
That's right. Chandler does still think I'm pregnant.
沒錯 錢德還是以為我懷孕了

67
00:05:29,820 --> 00:05:33,660
He hasn't asked me how I'm feeling or offered to carry my bags.
他沒有問我感覺如何 也沒有幫我提袋子

68
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:37,160
I feel bad for the woman who ends up with him.
我為跟他在一起的女人 覺得難過

69
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:41,260
After you, of course.
我是指在你之後的女人

70
00:05:41,470 --> 00:05:44,930
Don't worry. You only have to be pregnant for a few more hours..
別擔心，你只需要 再假裝懷孕幾小時…

71
00:05:45,110 --> 00:05:47,040
because I'm telling the father today.
因為今天我要告訴孩子的爸

72
00:05:47,210 --> 00:05:50,230
Is it someone in the building? That tall guy on the first floor?
他就住在這棟公寓嗎？ 是一樓那個高個兒嗎？

73
00:05:50,410 --> 00:05:54,180
-No! -What? I think he's cute.
-不 -什麼？我覺得他很可愛

74
00:05:54,350 --> 00:05:57,680
-Then you have his baby. -Believe me, I'm trying.
-那麼你可以去懷他的孩子 -相信我，我正在努力

75
00:05:59,020 --> 00:06:02,390
It's so weird. You're gonna tell this guy today..
這真的好奇怪 你今天要告訴這個男人…

76
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:05,150
and he has no idea what's gonna happen.
他不知道 會發生什麼事

77
00:06:05,330 --> 00:06:10,350
You're just gonna knock on his door and change his life forever.
你要敲敲他的門 永遠地改變他的一生

78
00:06:10,530 --> 00:06:13,990
You're like Ed McMahon, except without the big check.
你就像艾德麥馬漢 只不過手上沒有拿大額支票

79
00:06:14,340 --> 00:06:16,930
Or the raw sexual magnetism.
也沒有原始的性吸引力

80
00:06:18,540 --> 00:06:21,800
Yeah, well, I guess it is pretty big news.
對，我猜 那是個大消息

81
00:06:21,980 --> 00:06:25,280
Pretty big? It's huge! God, this guy doesn't have a clue.
大消息？它是超級大消息 天啊，這個男人什麼都不知道

82
00:06:25,450 --> 00:06:30,410
He's just walking down the street thinking, "I had sex with Rachel Greene. I rock!"
他走在街上心想 「我跟瑞秋葛林做愛，太帥了」

83
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:34,020
Then, bam! He's a father, everything's different.
然後，碰，他當了爸爸 一切都不一樣了

84
00:06:34,190 --> 00:06:38,350
It's only different if he wants it to be. I'm not gonna ask him for anything.
除非他真的想當爸爸 我不會對他提出任何要求

85
00:06:38,530 --> 00:06:40,590
He still has this huge decision to make.
他還是得做出 重大的決定

86
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:44,860
Now he's walking around thinking, "Do I want to be a dad?" Then, bam!
現在他邊走邊想 「我要當爸爸嗎？」然後，碰

87
00:06:45,030 --> 00:06:46,800
What was that "bam"?
這次怎麼了？

88
00:06:46,970 --> 00:06:50,670
I don't know. He's hit by a bus, or something.
我不知道 他可能是撞上巴士了

89
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:58,440
Joey, what would you do if someone you slept with told you she was pregnant?
喬伊，如果跟你上過床的女人 告訴你她懷孕了，你會怎麼辦？

90
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,450
Who called here?
誰打電話到這裡來？

91
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:12,420
Did she sound blond? Did she have an accent? I gotta make a call.
她聽起來像金髮美女嗎？她有口音嗎？ 我得去打個電話

92
00:07:12,590 --> 00:07:15,590
Should have never walked into that Sunglass Hut!
我不該到 那家太陽眼鏡專賣店的

93
00:07:16,660 --> 00:07:19,790
It's not you! You didn't get anybody pregnant.
不是你 你沒有讓任何人懷孕

94
00:07:20,100 --> 00:07:24,470
Why would you scare me like that? What the hell's going on?
你為什麼要那樣子嚇我？ 發生了什麼事？

95
00:07:26,570 --> 00:07:28,970
Is somebody pregnant?
有人懷孕了嗎？

96
00:07:30,110 --> 00:07:31,980
Oh, yeah! That's me.
對，我懷孕了

97
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:37,370
Oh, my God, Pheebs! You're gonna have a baby?
天啊，菲比 你要生孩子了？

98
00:07:37,550 --> 00:07:42,420
Yes, I am. Oh, my God, I'm gonna have a baby!
對 天啊，我要生孩子了

99
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:46,260
-Wait a minute, who's the father? -You don't know him.
-等一下，孩子的爸是誰？ -你不認識他

100
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:50,960
It's not important. He wants nothing to do with me or the baby.
那不重要 他不希望跟我或孩子扯上關係

101
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:59,470
Who is this guy? Because I will track him down and kick his ass!
這傢伙是誰？ 因為我要把他找出來，痛扁他一頓

102
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:03,070
-David Linn. -David Linn!
-大衛林恩 -大衛林恩

103
00:08:06,610 --> 00:08:10,610
-Who's David Linn? -Some guy from my gym. Little annoying.
-誰是大衛林恩？ -我在健身房認識的人，他很討厭

104
00:08:16,090 --> 00:08:19,220
-Chandler? -Did you find the cameras?
-錢德 -你找到即可拍了嗎？

105
00:08:19,430 --> 00:08:21,120
-No. Did you? -Yes.
-沒有，你呢？ -我找到了

106
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:24,360
That's why I'm under the table, celebrating.
那就是我躲在桌下的原因 我想要慶祝

107
00:08:25,230 --> 00:08:29,530
I checked in the lost and found. I talked to the manager. No one's turned them in.
我去失物中心問過管理員 沒有人撿到即可拍

108
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:34,640
Great. Those cameras were the only thing that was gonna cheer Monica up today.
太棒了，今天只有那些即可拍 能讓摩妮卡打起精神來

109
00:08:34,810 --> 00:08:37,610
You just got married. Why is she so depressed?
你們剛剛結婚 她為什麼要心情不好？

110
00:08:37,780 --> 00:08:42,110
All my energy is going into not asking that question.
我沒有力氣 問她那個問題

111
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:46,340
-I can't believe I screwed this up! -I'm sorry, man.
-我不敢相信我搞砸了 -我很遺憾，兄弟

112
00:08:48,590 --> 00:08:52,620
Here's a thought. This is the same ballroom.
我有個點子 你們在這個宴會廳請客

113
00:08:52,790 --> 00:08:56,290
There's a band. There's gonna be plenty of dressed-up people.
這裡有樂隊 等一下會有很多人盛裝前來

114
00:08:56,460 --> 00:08:59,590
Are you suggesting we dance our troubles away?
你建議 我們可以丟下問題不管？

115
00:08:59,770 --> 00:09:03,400
No, I'm saying we buy more of these at the gift shop..
不，我是說我們到禮品店 買一些即可拍…

116
00:09:03,570 --> 00:09:06,100
throw our tuxes back on and take a few pictures.
換上禮服 拍幾張照片

117
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:09,210
We just have to make sure not to get anybody's faces.
我們只要 不拍到任何人的臉

118
00:09:09,380 --> 00:09:10,870
Are you serious?
你是認真的嗎？

119
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:13,410
I'm thinking about your new bride at home.
我想到 在家等你的新娘

120
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:16,740
Do you want to start your life together by letting her down?
你想在你們共度一生的第一天 就讓她失望嗎？

121
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:19,980
Marriage advice? Really?
你真的要給我關於婚姻的建議？

122
00:09:21,990 --> 00:09:25,120
I'm telling you, this looks exactly like your wedding.
我是在告訴你 這看起來很像你的婚宴

123
00:09:25,290 --> 00:09:28,490
-Aren't these the same flowers? -I don't know. Monica picked them.
-這些花都一樣吧？ -我不知道，花是摩妮卡挑的

124
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:30,820
-What about the chairs? -Those too.
-椅子呢？ -也是

125
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,760
-The place settings? -Her.
-佈置呢？ -她挑的

126
00:09:32,930 --> 00:09:36,100
-What did you do? -I was in charge of the cameras.
-你做了什麼？ -我負責看好照相機

127
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:38,000
Gift shop?
禮品店？

128
00:09:43,810 --> 00:09:47,110
-Did you do it yet? -Not yet.
-你說了嗎？ -還沒有

129
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:51,010
Then what are you doing here? Are you about to do it?
那麼你在這裡做什麼？ 你真的要說嗎？

130
00:09:51,190 --> 00:09:53,020
Is it Gunther?
是阿甘嗎？

131
00:09:55,020 --> 00:09:59,360
-It's not Gunther! -Thank God. Because that hair on a baby?
-不是阿甘 -謝天謝地，還好寶寶不會有他的頭髮

132
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:04,300
The father is not here, okay? I haven't told him yet.
孩子的爸不在這裡，好嗎？ 我還沒有告訴他

133
00:10:04,470 --> 00:10:07,900
-I don't think I can tell him at all now. -Why not?
-我想現在我沒辦法告訴他 -為什麼？

134
00:10:08,070 --> 00:10:13,800
I was walking down the street, thinking, "I'm gonna tell the father." And then, bam!
我在街上邊走邊想 「我要告訴孩子的爸」，然後，碰

135
00:10:14,980 --> 00:10:16,500
Bus?
你撞到了巴士？

136
00:10:17,610 --> 00:10:22,910
No, you! You freaked me out. You kept saying how huge this all is.
不，是你，你嚇了我一跳 你一直在提醒我這是件大事

137
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,420
But it is huge.
但它的確是件大事

138
00:10:24,590 --> 00:10:28,020
I know. But I was just thinking about how huge it was for me.
我知道，我只是在想 它對我來說有多重要

139
00:10:28,190 --> 00:10:31,060
I didn't even go to how huge it'll be for the father.
我根本不知道 這對孩子的爸來說有多重要

140
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:35,820
You're thinking about this way too much. Just tell him and get it over with.
你想太多了 告訴他，把事情做個了斷

141
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:40,230
It's like ripping off this Band-Aid, quick and painless. Watch.
它就像撕掉OK繃一樣 越快越不痛，你看

142
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:42,300
Oh, mother of..!
天殺的…

143
00:10:44,670 --> 00:10:46,300
See?
看吧？

144
00:10:51,750 --> 00:10:56,980
-Are we opening presents? -No. I shouldn't have even opened these.
-我們要拆禮物了嗎？ -不，我根本不該拆開禮物

145
00:10:57,450 --> 00:11:02,150
Joey, I am out of control! You have to do me a favor.
喬伊，我控制不了自己 你得幫我一個忙

146
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:04,660
No matter what I say, no matter what I do..
不論我說什麼 不論我做什麼…

147
00:11:04,830 --> 00:11:07,890
please, do not let me open another present. Okay?
拜託，不要讓我 再拆開任何禮物，好嗎？

148
00:11:11,300 --> 00:11:13,130
Give me one more.
再給我一個禮物

149
00:11:16,470 --> 00:11:20,430
Oh, good, you're here. Pheebs? Listen..
很好，你來了 菲比，聽我說…

150
00:11:20,710 --> 00:11:24,240
-Sit down, I got something I wanna say. -All right.
-坐下，我要告訴你一件事 -好吧

151
00:11:31,150 --> 00:11:36,610
It's a scary world out there, especially for a single mom.
外面的世界很可怕 特別是對單親媽媽來說

152
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:40,590
I've always felt that you and I have a special bond.
我一直覺得 我跟你之間很特別

153
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,250
So..
所以…

154
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:47,160
Phoebe Buffay, will you marry me?
菲比布非，你願意嫁給我嗎？

155
00:11:50,970 --> 00:11:53,060
Oh, my God!
我的天啊

156
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,770
Oh, yeah, I'll marry you.
我願意嫁給你

157
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:03,840
-You can't marry him! -Hey, lady, your day's over. It's my turn.
-你不能嫁給他 -小姐，你結過婚了，這次輪到我

158
00:12:05,050 --> 00:12:08,450
-Why can't she marry me? -I can and I will.
-她為什麼不能嫁給我？ -我可以，我也願意

159
00:12:10,290 --> 00:12:14,630
She's not pregnant. Rachel's the one who's pregnant.
她沒有懷孕 是瑞秋懷孕了

160
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,700
Oh, my God!
天啊

161
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:20,230
He'd notice when you didn't have a baby in nine months!
九個月後你生不出孩子 他會發現的

162
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:22,460
It's Joey!
他是喬伊

163
00:12:23,540 --> 00:12:25,230
I love you.
我愛你

164
00:12:27,210 --> 00:12:31,910
Wait, I can't believe it! Rachel's pregnant? Who's the father?
等一下，我不敢相信 瑞秋懷孕了？孩子的爸是誰？

165
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,670
We don't know.
我們不知道

166
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:39,420
-I wonder if it's that dude. -There's a dude?
-不知道是不是那個傢伙 -哪個傢伙？

167
00:12:39,620 --> 00:12:41,090
Who is it?
是誰呢？

168
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:44,450
About a month ago this guy spent the night with Rachel.
大約一個月前 這傢伙跟瑞秋共度春宵

169
00:12:44,630 --> 00:12:47,090
I didn't see who it was, but..
我沒有看到他，但是…

170
00:12:52,630 --> 00:12:54,620
Was that story over?
他把故事說完了嗎？

171
00:12:58,510 --> 00:13:00,470
The guy left this.
那個傢伙留下這個

172
00:13:00,910 --> 00:13:05,280
Oh, my God! I know who the father is.
天啊 我知道孩子的爸是誰

173
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:12,340
People have got to finish their stories.
說故事的人 得把故事說完

174
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:23,050
Hello.
哈囉

175
00:13:27,330 --> 00:13:29,800
I don't know if we're both in. Come closer.
我不知道我們有沒有都照進去 靠近一點

176
00:13:30,870 --> 00:13:32,170
Nice aftershave.
你的古龍水味道很好聞

177
00:13:32,340 --> 00:13:35,710
If you want some, I've got eight mini bottles in my bag.
如果你想來一點 我包包裡有八罐隨身瓶

178
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:39,670
-Excuse me, could you take a picture of us? -Of course.
-對不起，你能幫我們拍照嗎？ -沒問題

179
00:13:43,820 --> 00:13:46,290
Would you take one of us?
你能幫我們照一張嗎？

180
00:13:47,050 --> 00:13:49,050
Yeah, sure.
沒問題

181
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:51,750
Click.
喀

182
00:13:52,790 --> 00:13:55,420
-It didn't click. -I heard it.
-我沒有聽到快門聲 -我聽到了

183
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:59,030
-But there was no flash. -Why won't you take our picture?
-但閃光燈沒亮 -你為什麼不幫我們拍照？

184
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,860
Oh, yeah. I'll take your picture.
對，我會幫你們拍照

185
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:05,800
Your finger was covering the lens.
你的手指擋到鏡頭了

186
00:14:05,970 --> 00:14:08,970
Who are you, Ansel Adams? Get out of here!
你是安瑟亞當斯嗎？ 快滾吧

187
00:14:10,282 --> 00:14:12,512
（中央咖啡廳）

188
00:14:13,250 --> 00:14:17,080
Look, I feel really bad about how I freaked you out before..
聽著，我真的很難過 之前我嚇壞你了…

189
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:20,410
so I asked the father to meet you here so you could tell him.
所以我請孩子的爸到裡面等你 你可以告訴他事實

190
00:14:20,620 --> 00:14:24,650
What? Wait a minute. How do you even know who the father is?
什麼？等一下 你怎麼知道孩子的爸是誰？

191
00:14:24,890 --> 00:14:28,090
I may play the fool at times..
或許有時候我傻傻的…

192
00:14:28,260 --> 00:14:32,890
but I'm more than a pretty blond girl with an ass that won't quit.
但事實上我是個勇不放棄的 金髮美女

193
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:38,060
I believe this belongs to the father of your baby..
我相信 這是孩子爸的衣服…

194
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:43,340
Oh, God. He's in there right now?
天啊，他就在裡面？

195
00:14:43,510 --> 00:14:49,350
You can turn around, or you can go rip the Band-Aid off. What do you want to do?
你可以轉身離開或是長痛不如短痛 你打算怎麼做？

196
00:14:51,490 --> 00:14:53,080
-Let's rip. -Are you sure?
-我們把事情做個了斷吧 -你確定？

197
00:14:53,250 --> 00:14:55,650
-Phoebe! -Okay. Sorry.
-菲比 -好吧，抱歉

198
00:14:58,530 --> 00:15:00,120
Hey, Rach.
瑞秋

199
00:15:07,270 --> 00:15:11,400
Why don't you go up on-stage. I'll get a picture of you doing the speech.
你為什麼不到台上呢？ 我要拍張你說話時的照片

200
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:33,290
Will the owner of a 1995 Buick LeSabre please see the front desk?
1995年別克李薩布利的車主 請跟櫃檯聯絡

201
00:15:33,460 --> 00:15:35,720
Your car is about to be towed.
你的車就要被拖走了

202
00:15:38,330 --> 00:15:40,460
That's my car!
那是我的車

203
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:44,740
-A '95 LeSabre? -Yes.
-1995年的李薩布利？ -對

204
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:47,730
-A green LeSabre? -Yes!
-綠色的李薩布利？ -對

205
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:54,310
-I'm sorry, I meant a blue LeSabre. -Yes, green-blue.
-抱歉，我是說藍色的李薩布利 -對，我的車是藍綠色的

206
00:15:57,990 --> 00:16:01,050
Well, go. Go move it!
快去把它移開吧

207
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:05,620
Ready for the last picture? Get ready to run.
準備要拍最後一張照片了嗎？ 拍完馬上就跑

208
00:16:11,370 --> 00:16:13,930
Congratulations on your wedding.
恭喜

209
00:16:20,670 --> 00:16:22,300
So, what's this about?
這是怎麼一回事？

210
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:25,000
Rachel has something she wants to tell you.
瑞秋有事 要告訴你

211
00:16:25,180 --> 00:16:29,450
And I believe that this is your red sweater.
我相信 這是你的紅毛衣

212
00:16:29,620 --> 00:16:33,710
No, this is my red sweater.
不，這才是我的紅毛衣

213
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:37,920
Oh, no.
不

214
00:16:40,330 --> 00:16:43,790
Could I get anyone a coffee?
有人要喝咖啡嗎？

215
00:16:44,330 --> 00:16:47,230
Or poison? No? Just for me? Okay.
或是毒藥？沒有嗎？只有我要？好吧

216
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:50,700
What's going on, Rach?
發生了什麼事？瑞秋

217
00:16:50,870 --> 00:16:55,240
Nothing. Phoebe kind of made a mistake.
沒事 菲比弄錯了

218
00:16:55,540 --> 00:17:00,610
But you do wear that sweater a lot. Are you involved in some kind of dare?
但你的確常穿那件毛衣 你在做什麼冒險的事嗎？

219
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:04,550
I'm actually glad Phoebe called.
事實上我很高興能接到菲比的電話

220
00:17:09,290 --> 00:17:13,020
I know we broke up because you thought I was immature, but I've grown up.
我知道我們會分手是因為你覺得 我太幼稚，但我已經長大了

221
00:17:13,190 --> 00:17:15,490
I think we should get back together.
我想我們應該復合

222
00:17:15,730 --> 00:17:18,320
It's just not the right time.
時機不對

223
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:23,300
It is the right time. I'm ready for more.
時機非常恰當 我做了萬全的準備

224
00:17:23,470 --> 00:17:25,840
Come on, Rach. Let's give it another try.
來吧，瑞秋 我們可以再試一次

225
00:17:26,970 --> 00:17:29,070
I'm having a baby.
我懷孕了

226
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:39,680
-You can go. -Thank you.
-你可以走了 -謝謝

227
00:17:44,830 --> 00:17:47,760
I don't know how any of these got opened!
我不知道 禮物怎麼會是打開的

228
00:17:49,100 --> 00:17:53,000
-You opened them all? -I know, I am a terrible person.
-你拆開了所有的禮物？ -我知道，我是個可怕的人

229
00:17:53,170 --> 00:17:57,040
Chandler's never gonna trust me with anything ever again.
錢德永遠都不會 再相信我任何事

230
00:17:57,570 --> 00:17:59,200
You got my parents' gift.
你拆開了我爸媽的禮物

231
00:17:59,370 --> 00:18:03,170
-What is that? -I think it does something to salami.
-那是什麼？ -應該是跟意大利臘腸有關的東西

232
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:09,710
-How'd it go? -What did Tag say?
-情況如何？ -泰格怎麼說？

233
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:13,280
Tag is not the father. And Joey knows now?
泰格不是孩子的爸 喬伊知道了？

234
00:18:13,450 --> 00:18:17,410
I do, Rach, I do. And I am so happy for you.
我知道了，瑞秋 我為你感到高興

235
00:18:20,090 --> 00:18:23,620
Wow, you didn't even try to unhook my bra.
你沒有試著 要解開我的胸罩

236
00:18:25,970 --> 00:18:31,530
-So are you ever gonna tell whoever it is? -I will. I'm just not up for it tonight.
-你要告訴孩子的爸嗎？ -我會的，只是今晚我不想那麼做

237
00:18:31,710 --> 00:18:35,640
No matter what this guy says, you're not gonna be alone in this.
不論這傢伙說什麼 你不會獨自面對這一切

238
00:18:35,810 --> 00:18:38,680
-I'm not? -No. Listen..
-是嗎？ -不，聽著…

239
00:18:42,050 --> 00:18:47,390
It's a scary world out there, especially for a single mom.
外面的世界很可怕 特別是對單親媽媽來說

240
00:18:47,550 --> 00:18:52,890
I've always felt like you and I have this special bond, you know?
我一直覺得 我跟你之間很特別

241
00:18:53,060 --> 00:18:55,590
-Rachel Greene, will you marry me? -What?
-瑞秋葛林，你願意嫁給我嗎？ -什麼？

242
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:57,820
-What? -What?!
-什麼？ -什麼？

243
00:18:59,030 --> 00:19:01,690
-Pheebs, give me the ring back. -No!
-菲比，把戒指還給我 -不

244
00:19:02,170 --> 00:19:08,300
Joey, you're so sweet, so sweet, honey. But I'm not looking for a husband.
喬伊，你真的很體貼 但我不要一個丈夫

245
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:13,800
I understand.
我瞭解

246
00:19:16,450 --> 00:19:20,780
Well, if you'll excuse me, I'm going to go and lie down.
對不起 我想去躺一下

247
00:19:25,831 --> 00:19:26,889
喬伊

248
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:31,230
What? I proposed to you. It balances out.
什麼？我跟你求過婚 這樣才公平

249
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:39,570
I can't say that didn't hurt.
我不能說我不心痛

250
00:19:41,610 --> 00:19:44,010
But I'll take you back, Joey Tribbiani.
但我會原諒你，喬伊崔比亞尼

251
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:47,640
-Listen, about that, I only offered.. -Ooh, a Salami Buddy!
-聽著，我只是說… -意大利臘腸用具

252
00:19:47,810 --> 00:19:49,280
There you go!
來吧

253
00:19:51,020 --> 00:19:52,650
-We're back! -Great.
-我們回來了 -太棒了

254
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:56,310
We're hanging in the kitchen. Let's stay in the kitchen.
我們待在廚房吧 待在廚房就好了

255
00:19:57,590 --> 00:20:00,820
-It's picture time. -You're gonna love these.
-現在是看照片時間 -你一定會喜歡的

256
00:20:00,990 --> 00:20:03,190
Here's a picture of Ross.
這是羅斯的照片

257
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:05,930
And that's me.
那是我

258
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:09,430
And that's me and Ross.
我跟羅斯

259
00:20:11,070 --> 00:20:14,940
And here's a picture of our first kiss as a married couple.
這是我們第一次 以新婚夫妻身份接吻的照片

260
00:20:15,110 --> 00:20:18,410
Wow, that is a great picture. Yeah!
那張照片真的很棒

261
00:20:18,580 --> 00:20:22,950
And interesting, because I found the cameras in one of our bags.
真的太有趣了 因為我在我們的行李裡找到即可拍

262
00:20:26,420 --> 00:20:28,680
Didn't see that coming.
我沒想到這一點

263
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:31,920
So this isn't a picture of our first kiss..
這不是 我們第一次接吻的照片…

264
00:20:32,090 --> 00:20:36,120
but it is a picture of my first kiss with this lady.
但它的確是 我跟這位女士第一次接吻的照片

265
00:20:37,830 --> 00:20:42,430
Which, by the look on your face, I'm sure you'll remember, so there's no need..
從你臉上的表情看來 我相信你會記得，所以我不必…

266
00:20:44,570 --> 00:20:48,630
-I'll take the real pictures to get developed. -Good idea.
-我會拿真的底片去洗 -好主意

267
00:20:52,950 --> 00:20:56,880
You opened all the presents without me? We were gonna do that together.
你不管我自己拆開所有禮物？ 我們說好要一起拆的

268
00:20:57,050 --> 00:20:59,350
You kissed another woman?!
你吻了另一個女人？

269
00:21:00,850 --> 00:21:02,520
-Call it even? -Okay.
-我們扯平了？ -好吧

270
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:13,620
-I'm gonna go get these in some water. -You stole those from that wedding?
-我要把花插到花瓶裡 -你偷走了那個婚禮的花？

271
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:18,070
No, the hotel lobby. They think they can charge me for some dirty movie..
不，這是飯店大廳的花 他們以為能超收我黃色電影…

272
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:21,700
and a bag of Mashuga Nuts, they got another thing coming!
還有一袋糖果的錢 我一定要討回公道

273
00:21:25,310 --> 00:21:27,540
Hey, my sweater!
我的毛衣

274
00:21:30,220 --> 00:21:33,120
I've been looking for this for, like, a month.
我找這件毛衣 找了一個月

275
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:39,990
Oh, my God!
我的天啊

276
00:21:47,070 --> 00:21:48,660
Oh, my God!
我的天啊

277
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:59,400
-Hey, how you doing? -Good. Long time no see.
-你好嗎？ -我很好，好久不見

278
00:22:00,310 --> 00:22:04,010
-Like your sweater. -Right back at you.
-我喜歡你的毛衣 -我也是

279
00:22:06,120 --> 00:22:11,580
-It's crazy about Rachel. -Well, she's one crazy lady.
-瑞秋的事真的太瘋狂了 -她一直都瘋瘋癲癲的

280
00:22:12,330 --> 00:22:17,230
-So whose is it? -I don't know, some Italian guy.
-到底是誰的呢？ -我不知道，應該是個意大利人吧

281
00:22:18,770 --> 00:22:23,000
Come on, read your own label. See you later. He is so weird.
少來了，看看你自己的標籤 後會有期，他真是奇怪

282
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


283
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
